From fc88802dfb4111a38990cd671a0bcf995915e07c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhen XIN <lone.zen6@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:04:31 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/14] platform: add custom peripheral and userspace
 interfaces

Port configfs device-tree overlays, GPIO wake events, userspace regulator OF support, X1000 RTC handling, Ingenic UART timing, SC16IS7x2 GPIO support, configurable TTY buffering and DWC2 PIO mode.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
